{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A super chaotic puzzle game of macho x agriculture! ?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's raise various kinds of machos that are born by sowing protein in the field with care and love and ship them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The director of the macho farm loves muscles so much that he ends up opening a ``macho farm.''</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bury a mysterious seed called ``Macho Seed'' in the soil and feed it with protein instead of water.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A few days later, small dumbbell buds will appear, and the scent of muscles will fill the entire field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People from the next town say: &quot;Isn't there some kind of protein wind blowing?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The grown machos work hard on squats and bench presses every day, Gradually, your pectoral muscles will grow and your abdominal muscles will start to crack...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Only 3 steps to ship!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2460Put protein in the field</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Macho will be born by sowing 3 types of proteins in the field!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of macho colors can be created by combining colors...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2461 Cultivate macho character</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By giving more protein to the newly born macho, the level will increase!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's grow it well and prepare for shipping!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2462Shipping together</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get a high score by shipping many machos at once!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's grow muscle well according to the shape of protein!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Cool Shades","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3518620/7362ebb0b2f3169da5c4b1d77ac1951ac426e0a3.jpg"},{"name":"Tick\u2026Tock\u2026Boom!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3518620/1296a0f47eefdb3bf74913e1feffcdf280d83f9a.jpg"},{"name":"Chest Sizzle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3518620/48ec523181eb3bf559342f9675678225242e763d.jpg"},{"name":"Champion\u2019s Trophy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3518620/47cf09f0e3dee58607865666ea82cab301f7aa30.jpg"},{"name":"Let\u2019s Party Night","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3518620/98953c9245b4d34e646ac3fd5289dd0c6cf9507c.jpg"},{"name":"Delivering Machos","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3518620/443b6c56b145a9acf21f99fc4f1d3dfaf2b01d4b.jpg"},{"name":"Delivering More Machos","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3518620/81a736bd612ee7b6d28fb8909d0cc1dee7109160.jpg"},{"name":"Still Delivering Machos","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3518620/446081a270b7de256af1d4d91cb1142306e580cf.jpg"},{"name":"Small Fortune","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3518620/4cc5039efa5fce81cc410b32a39895ef85f2da0f.jpg"},{"name":"Big Fortune","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3518620/4e297f6c6f4a4f77842c10799a8ea669372b77c7.jpg"}],"total":15},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3518620?t=1766589084","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3518620?t=1766589084","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518620/b46676709a5d98835bb049192715d447339f466c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766589084","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518620/b46676709a5d98835bb049192715d447339f466c/capsule_184x6